    <briefdescription>
<para>A type that represents either a value of type T or an <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Error" kindref="compound">Error</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Expected&lt;T&gt; stores both the value and error in a fixed-size structure. No dynamic allocation is used - all storage is static.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the expected value</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
